# Stone Hill deploy (treasurer Git)

Stone Hill (`www.shmspto.org`) deploys from **`auraflux-dev/shmspto`**, not this monorepo's `origin`.

## Agent ship path (required)

1. **Edit in `~/shmspto`** for school site, portal, and staff (see **`shms-edit-home.mdc`**). Prefer moving the agent root there when the task is Stone Hill.
2. **Serena QA** on the changed files.
3. **Commit** in the **`shmspto` repo** (local clone, e.g. `~/shmspto`).
   - If you already edited `frontend/` here in `pavilion`, port the same diff into `~/shmspto/frontend/` before commit.
   - Do **not** treat `git push origin main` on `pavilion` as a Stone Hill production deploy.
4. **`node scripts/shms-frontend-parity.mjs`**. Fix any school-facing “only in monorepo” hits.
5. **`git push origin main`** on `auraflux-dev/shmspto`.
6. Treasurer Vercel project **`frontend`** auto-builds Production from that push.
7. **`node scripts/check-prod-deploy.mjs`** from the `shmspto` repo. Git push alone is not done until this passes on https://www.shmspto.org.

## Agents cannot CLI-deploy Stone Hill

- Do **not** run `vercel deploy --prod` for Stone Hill from agent shells (no treasurer Vercel login).
- Do **not** deploy Stone Hill from `robert-4220s-projects` or Pavilion projects.
- CLI fallback (`node scripts/deploy-production.mjs`) is Rob-only with treasurer login. See `~/shmspto/scripts/DEPLOY.md`.

## Staging + Rob OK (visitor-facing)

For public visitor UI (not staff-only): Rob reviews on **https://shmspto.vercel.app** when staging is current, then OK before pushing `shmspto` `main` for production.

Staff-only (`/staff`, `app/api/staff`, staff components with no visitor copy change): push `shmspto` `main` after Serena QA without waiting for Rob OK.

## Pavilion (this repo)

Pavilion marketing/demo/trial still ship from **`pavilion`** (`commons-site`, `commons-pto-demo`, `commons-pto`) per `commons-parity.mdc`. Never mix SHMS Wix env onto Pavilion.
